      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "何してるの？"
    },
    {
      "author": "pergpau",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4705",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "今日は６月１８日で、ムーリエルの誕生日です！"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4706",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "お誕生日おめでとうムーリエル！"
    },
    {
      "author": "fabioedri",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4707",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "ムーリエルは２０歳になりました。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4708",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "パスワードは「Muiriel」です。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4709",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "すぐに戻ります。"
    },
    {
      "author": "e4zh1nmcz",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4710",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "知らない。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4711",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "何と言ったら良いか分かりません。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4712",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "きりがない。"
    },
    {
      "author": "e4zh1nmcz",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4713",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "何と言ったらいいか・・・。"
    },
    {
      "author": "mookeee",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4714",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "こいつは悪いウサギだった。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4715",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "私は山にいました。"
    },
    {
      "author": "Swift",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4716",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "それは最近の写真？"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4717",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "時間があるか分かりません。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4718",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "先程、どういうわけかマイクが入りませんでした。"
    },
    {
      "author": "mookeee",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4720",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "この世界の教育にはがっかりしてしまう。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4726",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "私は一日に100ユーロ稼ぎます。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4727",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "すぐに諦めて昼寝をするかも知れない。"
    },
    {
      "author": "Sim5634",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4728",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "それはあなたが一人になりたくないからです。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4729",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "そんなことは起きないでしょう。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4730",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "彼は時々変です。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4731",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "あなたの勉強を邪魔しないようにします。"
    },
    {
      "author": "mookeee",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4732",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "みんなもそうなのかな、と思うことくらいしかできない。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4733",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "長い目で見れば違ってくると思います。"
    },
    {
      "author": "Swift",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4734",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "心配しないで。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4735",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "会えなくて淋しい。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4736",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "明日帰ったら電話します。"
    },
    {
      "author": "lunefumet",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4737",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "私はいつも不思議な性格の方が好きだった。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4738",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "眠った方がいいよ。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4739",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "行くよ。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4740",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "私は彼らにチケットをもう一枚送ってくれるように頼んだ。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4741",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "君は僕にとてもいらいらしている。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4742",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "私はそんな風には生きられない。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4743",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "私は一時期、天体物理学者になりたかった。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4744",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "生物学は好きになれません。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4745",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "僕が最後に自分の考えを伝えた人は、僕を気違いだと思ったようだ。"
    },
    {
      "author": "bunbuku",
      "language": "ja",
      "license_id": "CC-BY-2.0-FR",
      "origin_url": "https://tatoeba.org/en/terms_of_use",
      "record_id": "tatoeba:4746",
      "retrieval_date": "2026-11-03",
      "section": "sentences",
      "sentence_slot": "sentence.statement",
      "source_id": "tatoeba.sentences",
      "status": "keep",
      "text": "残念ながらそれは本当なのです。"
    }
